      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A dramatic illustration of catheter-induced left main coronary artery spasm is described. Timely recognition of spasm and use of intracoronary nitroglycerine confirmed this condition and saved a young woman from an unnecessary coronary artery bypass graft operation."},
